rls find romantic, he'll be spending even more time with her \"researching\" while remaining completely clueless. Could Chiyo's romantic frustration possibly get any more drawn out of proportion?\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)"},"tags":[{"name":"Parody","rank":94,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Drawing","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":87,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Unrequited Love","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Otaku Culture","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Work","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gender Bending","rank":62,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":62,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tomboy","rank":55,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":48,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":46,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":45,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Educational","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crossdressing","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Monthly Girls' Nozaki-kun","english":"Monthly Girls' Nozaki-kun","native":"月刊少女野崎くん","romaji":"Gekkan Shoujo Nozaki-kun","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"月刊少女野崎君"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"月刊少女野崎同學"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Monthly Girls` Nozaki-kun"}]},"trailer":{"id":"-tHbKBCTDFQ","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-tHbKBCTDFQ/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}